# Mechanic: Venture into a dungeon, choose branches, complete it, and enter again.
# Forcing: Acererak returns to hand until Tomb is complete, permitting five Ventures.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield, no choices during the human main phase.
# Failure modes: Missing choices or room effects stall the path. Completion removes the dungeon.
# Card roles: Acererak supplies Venture. Fifteen Swamps pay for five casts. A second copy supplies the draw.
# Protocol path: Catalog SelectN choices, Command dungeon, room abilities, persistent DungeonStatus.
[metadata]
